      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Follow us on Instagram @doran_estates to see our new listings first! **EMAIL ENQUIRIES ONLY/NO PHONE CALLS** \r\n\r\nDoran Estates are delighted to present this superb two-bedroom apartment to the rental market, ideally situated within the well-maintained and ever-popular Swan Hall development in the heart of Belgard Square, Tallaght.\r\n\r\nThis bright and spacious apartment is thoughtfully designed to offer both comfort and practicality. Upon entering, a welcoming hallway with a convenient storage press sets the tone for the well-laid-out accommodation. The fully fitted kitchen opens seamlessly into a generous living and dining area, creating a versatile space ideal for everyday living as well as entertaining. From here, access is provided to a large private balcony, which is also accessible from both bedrooms, enhancing the indoor-outdoor flow.\r\nBoth double bedrooms are well-proportioned and feature built-in wardrobes, ensuring ample storage. A centrally located main bathroom completes the accommodation. The property further benefits from dual-aspect balconies, allowing for excellent natural light throughout the day and offering flexible outdoor space to enjoy at any time.\r\n\r\nThe location is second to none, positioned directly opposite The Square Shopping Centre and within walking distance of a wide range of local amenities including Tallaght Hospital, TU Dublin Tallaght Campus, and the Civic Theatre and Library. Residents can enjoy immediate access to supermarkets such as Aldi, Tesco, and Dunnes Stores, along with a variety of cafés, restaurants, and leisure facilities.\r\nTransport links are exceptional, with the Red LUAS line terminus just moments from the development, providing a direct and reliable route to Dublin City Centre. Numerous Dublin Bus routes service the area, while the nearby M50 ensures easy connectivity to both north and south Dublin and beyond.\r\nThis is an excellent opportunity to secure a well-presented apartment in a highly convenient and well-connected location. \r\n\r\nEarly viewing is strongly advised."
